  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Helvetic Business School (HBS) is a private business school in the French-speaking region of Switzerland. It offers a boutique, skill-based education that focuses on real-world business practice.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At HBS, you’ll experience a close-knit, international community grounded in Swiss culture. The Vevey campus offers both high living standards and access to major business hubs like Geneva and Lausanne. With small classes and personal attention from experienced faculty, HBS provides a practical, hands-on learning experience in a beautiful Swiss setting.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>HBS does not have its own university accommodation, but its administration can assist you with finding options. You can also seek private housing, and the administration can guide you through the process.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The school has a physical library that contains a collection of academic books, journals, and other materials.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
